 a struggle fast.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"pvn-card pvn-card-danger\">\n        <div class=\"pvn-video-wrap\">\n          <span class=\"pvn-video-label\">After clipping</span>\n          <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload=\"metadata\" poster=\"{{ 'pawosa-sharp-poster.jpg' | file_url }}\">\n            <source src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/e78a2770c071427d955fb37923a58886.mov\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n          </video>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pvn-content\">\n          <h3 class=\"pvn-title\">Sharp edges scratch</h3>\n          <p class=\"pvn-copy\">Clipping alone can leave rough tips on paws, skin, and furniture.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"pvn-card\">\n        <div class=\"pvn-video-wrap\">\n          <span class=\"pvn-video-label\">Cleanup</span>\n          <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload=\"metadata\" poster=\"{{ 'pawosa-mess-poster.jpg' | file_url }}\">\n            <source src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/e78a2770c071427d955fb37923a58886.mov\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n          </video>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"pvn-content\">\n          <h3 class=\"pvn-title\">Mess gets everywhere</h3>\n          <p class=\"pvn-copy\">Tiny nail pieces scatter fast and turn grooming into cleanup time.</p>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"pvn-highlight\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"pvn-highlight-title\">Pawosa helps make trims calmer, cleaner, and smoother.</p>\n        <p class=\"pvn-highlight-copy\">\n          A pet-care upgrade designed to help you trim with more confidence at home.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <a class=\"pvn-cta\" href=\"/cart\">Make Trims Easier</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
